BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7368277cc373@community-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261110T195738Z
DTSTART:20261204T173000
DTEND:20261204T183000
SUMMARY:Ferndale Fire Co 3 Hook & Ladder Turkey Shoot
LOCATION:The Palace Saloon
DESCRIPTION:The annual Company 3 fundraiser\, on Hospitality Night. Roll t
 he dice for the best poker hand and win prizes including smoked chickens\
 , smoked turkeys\, hams and t-shirts. T-shirts are available too. Your su
 pport helps the company keep its mission going.
END:VEVENT
